{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0002": "$g : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0004": "$i : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{T} \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0005": "$g$", "MATH_0006": "$i$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0008": "$i$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0010": "$i$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0012": "$i$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{Y} \\to \\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0014": "$i$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\item", "STRUCT_0007": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-semi-diagonal}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:31bac9ffd695b4681d18b7040e864bc4169ae8e2a95c74ac948d8282dd6aaad6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:af404f00d5df1a2c5cc562a9fed958f629e634bfc79ab7f94156f63064eaa8b3", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a morphism of algebraic stacks over <MATH_0003>. Consider the graph\n<MATH_0004> of <MATH_0005>. Then\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0006> is representable by algebraic spaces and locally of finite type,\n<STRUCT_0003> if <MATH_0007> is DM, then <MATH_0008> is unramified,\n<STRUCT_0004> if <MATH_0009> is quasi-DM, then <MATH_0010> is locally\nquasi-finite,\n<STRUCT_0005> if <MATH_0011> is separated, then <MATH_0012> is proper, and\n<STRUCT_0006> if <MATH_0013> is quasi-separated, then <MATH_0014> is\nquasi-compact and quasi-separated.\n<STRUCT_0007>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:e5ffc2c3c269d0d9f08e345424ef993401bc38522e0185cde017bacf62e82fcc", "unit_id": "tag:050I:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X} = \\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{Y} \\to\n\\mathcal{X} \\times_\\mathcal{T} \\mathcal{Y}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-fibre-product-after-map}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2dfca54a5b8044471087142ba92c5b63bb76c5865acbc8a6f74139626bfbf55e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:53b592b22313d00a294b563eea06a1d023a19dc55b9524fcf017d810d00b3c51", "source_text": "This is a special case of Lemma <REF_0001>\napplied to the morphism\n<MATH_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:df059cb9374f7ba455395d113d6c4b3dfb42800898985c7269587975ff1b3224", "unit_id": "tag:050I:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YV", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0002": "$s : \\mathcal{T} \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$f \\circ s$", "MATH_0004": "$2$", "MATH_0005": "$\\text{id}_\\mathcal{T}$", "MATH_0006": "$s$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "MATH_0008": "$s$", "MATH_0009": "$f$", "MATH_0010": "$s$", "MATH_0011": "$f$", "MATH_0012": "$s$", "MATH_0013": "$f$", "MATH_0014": "$s$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\item", "STRUCT_0007": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-section-immersion}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f4d0cf44a5194980d146d1d0762221555475be1a0ff71fee824cc28e2d6286d0", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8a92c472850d915d9b3cd515537a01d526e1ae8a6c980eae547607caf64a3aea", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a morphism such that\n<MATH_0003> is <MATH_0004>-isomorphic to <MATH_0005>. Then\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0006> is representable by algebraic spaces and locally of finite type,\n<STRUCT_0003> if <MATH_0007> is DM, then <MATH_0008> is unramified,\n<STRUCT_0004> if <MATH_0009> is quasi-DM, then <MATH_0010> is locally quasi-finite,\n<STRUCT_0005> if <MATH_0011> is separated, then <MATH_0012> is proper, and\n<STRUCT_0006> if <MATH_0013> is quasi-separated, then <MATH_0014> is quasi-compact and quasi-separated.\n<STRUCT_0007>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0dbbd7cd99759c2c7f9131789adaf5fd06e22923523ae19fc81d059b2acd9938", "unit_id": "tag:050J:statement"}
